          "entityId": "fresh-indexed-search"
        }
      ],
      "criteria": [
        "A glob without / matches file names at any depth; ** crosses directories and * does not",
        "find_files hides ignored files and filters by glob",
        "read returns numbered lines and a continuation hint when the budget is small",
        "read refuses paths that escape the root, also through a symlinked directory",
        "search finds matches in path order with context and pages with offset",
        "search reports a bad regex with the dialect notes and treats literal text literally",
        "search narrows candidates with the index and still finds an edit made a moment ago",
        "files and count modes list matching files and per-file counts",
        "ignore_case finds text whose ASCII case differs",
        "A pattern .NET rejects is answered by an external PCRE engine when one is installed"
      ],
